      "t": "A bright second-floor flat in a converted warehouse next to the canal. The living room has two large windows over the water and an open kitchen with a gas hob and a dishwasher. Both bedrooms fit a double bed; the second one is smaller and has no wardrobe."
    },
    {
      "inMain": false,
      "k": "p",
      "links": 0,
      "t": "The building has a lift, a bicycle store and a secure door with a video entry phone. There is no parking space, but the station is a six-minute walk away. Pets are not allowed. Council tax band B."
    },
